<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Jizerskohorské bučiny: Oldřichovský Špičák loop — Jizerskohorské bučiny: Oldřichovský Špičák loop</name><desc>Start beside the Oldřichov ecocentre and climb through beech forest to the Oldřichovský Špičák lookout. Continue via Hřebenový buk to the Skalní hrad viewpoint, then descend through Oldřichovské sedlo and return through the village. Both rocky summit spurs are included; the lower shared paths allow walking.

